//+------------------------------------------------------------------+
//|                                                   ORB Strategy   |
//|                    Opening Range Breakout (MT5 Expert Advisor)  |
//| Features: Multi-session (NY/London) with local-time inputs,     |
//| risk-based sizing, RR targets, daily/overall DD halts, filters, |
//| ATR trailing, breakeven, cooldown, stats panel, ORB lines,      |
